Z||000004||California_Gold||09-14-2001||11:35 PM||||hope this helps but...<P>it sounds like the same problem i was having.  it went away and came back.  Check the gaskets around the exhaust manifolds (they blow real easy belive it or not), check for cylinder blowby, and check for any open exhaust component (muffler, catalytic converter, a leak at the EGR valve, possible valve probelm (which mine had) or even head gaskets...||||reg||3
